# 【B:controller】同樣的 controller 實驗
$ docker stop controller3 controller2;等 KafkaJmxControllerMissing 與 KafkaJmxActiveControllerCountNotOne
▶ 先停 1 台 controller(還有多數,叢集照常),再停第 2 台(失去多數,沒有 active controller)
停 controller3(剩 2/3 仍有多數)
   45 秒後 KafkaJmxControllerMissing 觸發(目前 firing:KafkaBrokerFenced,KafkaJmxControllerMissing,KafkaJmxScrapeDown,KafkaOfflinePartitions)
再停 controller2(只剩 1/3,失去多數)
   23 秒後 KafkaJmxActiveControllerCountNotOne 觸發(目前 firing:KafkaBrokerFenced,KafkaJmxActiveControllerCountNotOne,KafkaJmxControllerMissing,KafkaJmxScrapeDown,KafkaOfflinePartitions)
Alertmanager 收到 KafkaJmxActiveControllerCountNotOne:1(1=是)
恢復 controller2、controller3
   12 秒後 KafkaJmxActiveControllerCountNotOne 解除
   145 秒後 KafkaJmxControllerMissing 解除
判定:controller 掉線觸發 ControllerMissing;失去多數時 active controller 數不是 1 的告警觸發,恢復後都解除(來源:jmx)
